Package: globalvuln
Type: Package
Title: Global Humanitarian Vulnerability Indices
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Matthew", "Gwynfryn Thomas", , "matthewgthomas@gmail.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Country-level data from published global vulnerability, fragility,
    development, hunger, health, gender, debt, safeguarding, and displacement
    indices. Publisher scores are retained on their original scales, while
    ranks and deciles use a common direction in which one indicates the most
    vulnerable country.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
LazyDataCompression: xz
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
URL: https://matthewgthomas.co.uk/globalvuln/
